# {{name}} — ASP.NET Core API

This is the **{{name}}** backend service built with ASP.NET Core minimal APIs.

## Structure

```
├── Program.cs                     # Application entry point and host configuration
├── appsettings.json               # Production configuration
├── appsettings.Development.json   # Development overrides
├── Common/
│   ├── Extensions/                # DI and service registration
│   │   └── ServiceExtensions.cs
│   └── Middleware/                # Cross-cutting middleware
│       └── ExceptionMiddleware.cs
└── Features/                      # Feature folders (vertical slices)
    └── <Feature>/
        ├── <Feature>Controller.cs # HTTP endpoints
        ├── <Feature>Service.cs    # Business logic
        ├── Models/                # Request/response models
        ├── Validators/            # FluentValidation validators
        └── Entities/              # EF Core entities
```

## Rules

- One feature folder per domain concept (vertical slice architecture)
- Controllers handle HTTP concerns only, services contain business logic
- Use FluentValidation for request validation
- All service methods must be async (Task<T> return types)
- Use dependency injection — register in ServiceExtensions.cs
- Max 250 lines per file
- EF Core queries use IQueryable with projections, not loading full entities
- Use structured logging via Serilog (no string interpolation in log calls)
